flowchart LR
    Nx[Nx Workspace] --> Monorepo(Frontend Monorepo)
    Monorepo --> WizardApp[Nacora Wizard App]
    Monorepo --> PortalApp[Nacora Portal App]
    Monorepo --> SharedLibs(Shared Libraries)

    WizardApp --> Redux[Redux Toolkit State]
    PortalApp --> Redux
    SharedLibs --> Redux

    WizardApp --> API[Endpoint Wrapper API]
    PortalApp --> API
    SharedLibs --> API

    API --> Django[Django Backend]
    Django --> Webpack[Webpack Loader]
    Webpack --> WizardApp
    Webpack --> PortalApp

    PortalApp -- Dual Mode --> CSP(CSP Mode)
    PortalApp -- Dual Mode --> BO(BO Mode)